Package: tandemrng
Title: Tandem8x32 Pseudorandom Number Generator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jessica", "Cox", email = "jmcox@posteo.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A noncryptographic pseudorandom number generator, Tandem8x32, built to be
    fast on CPUs and GPUs alike. The package wraps the reference C implementation and
    produces the same stream, bit for bit, as the other implementations of the
    specification <https://github.com/tandem-rng/spec>. It provides generators with
    cheap splitting by index, by purpose and by fork, fills of uniform doubles and of
    unsigned words, and a hook that makes Tandem the base R generator through
    RNGkind("user-supplied").
